---
description: Prepare one reviewTastings evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: KitchenProductionPlan[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Interpret structured tasting and service rehearsal notes to identify creative and practical improvements. Distinguish subjective preference from repeatable defects, revise the smallest relevant components, and revalidate cost, dietary information, and service dependencies after every change. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
